{"output":"I’ll inspect the search code and test setup, make a focused fix, and run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nThe controller lets every completed request update state. I’ll add a request counter, advanced even when the query is cleared, and guard results, errors, and loading updates against stale requests.\n\nAll four existing tests pass. They don’t cover overlapping requests, so I’ll also run an in-memory race check without changing any test files.\n\nFixed src/search/controller.ts with a request counter. Only the latest search can update results, errors, or loading. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API and normal behavior are unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; in-memory race checks passed; git diff --check passed (exit 0).\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed.","final_output":"Fixed src/search/controller.ts with a request counter. Only the latest search can update results, errors, or loading. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API and normal behavior are unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; in-memory race checks passed; git diff --check passed (exit 0).\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":15,"tool_calls":[{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; ls -a","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-m_m99ddq/5-1-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":200,"stdout_bytes":134,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-933556098dcefcf7d736bb9fe6295ec8.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"grep_files","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test; git diff --check; git diff --stat","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-m_m99ddq/5-1-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":304,"stdout_bytes":521,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-cc44e5c1a788f21e682a27259497ab1d.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"node --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst item = title => [{ id: title, title, url: '/' }];\nfor (const outcome of ['resolve', 'reject']) {\n  for (const phase of ['pending', 'finished', 'cleared']) {\n    const requests = [];\n    const c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => requests.push({ resolve, reject })) });\n    const old = c.search('old');\n    const current = c.search('current');\n    if (phase === 'finished') { requests[1].resolve(item('current')); await current; }\n    if (phase === 'cleared') await c.search('   ');\n    const expected = c.getState();\n    requests[0][outcome](outcome === 'resolve' ? item('old') : new Error('old failure'));\n    await old;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), expected);\n    if (phase !== 'finished') {\n      requests[1].resolve(item('current'));\n      await current;\n      if (phase === 'cleared') assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null });\n      else assert.deepEqual(c.getState().results, item('current'));\n    }\n  }\n}\nconsole.log('PASS: stale success/failure while latest pending, finished, or cleared; late results after clear');\nNODE\n git diff --check","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-m_m99ddq/5-1-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":78,"stdout_bytes":97,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-c2d3c3127eff914be2923b998fa08697.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":64686,"output_tokens":1150}}
